\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. For ever here my rest shall be,
\par Close to Thy bleeding side;
\par This all my hope, and all my plea,
\par For me the Saviour died.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. My dying Saviour, and my God,
\par Fountain for guilt and sin,
\par Sprinkle me ever with Thy blood,
\par And cleanse, and keep me clean.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Wash me, and make me thus Thine own,
\par Wash me, and mine Thou art,
\par Wash me, but not my feet alone,
\par My hands, my head, my heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. The atonement of Thy blood apply,
\par Till faith to sight improve,
\par Till hope in full fruition die,
\par And all my soul be love.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

